title: "forceBalanceCAFoam"
abstract: >-
  Force-balance-based dynamic contact angle model for multiple droplets in
  OpenFOAM-7: parallel droplet identification, per-droplet drag and adhesion,
  and solver coupling with contact angle hysteresis.
